    "title": "Jasper's Terry Gobert named to ABCA Hall of Fame - NewsBreak",
    "text": "JASPER, Ind. (WEHT) — It was another incredible year for the Jasper Wildcats Baseball Team. A group and a community that lives and breathes baseball showed up again for their 18th state championship appearance. The man behind their success for the past 38 seasons is getting some much deserved recognition. Terry Gobert was inducted into the American Baseball Coaches Association Hall Of Fame (ABCA). The ABCA has been around since 1945 honoring the best coaches in the game. In his 38 seasons as head coach Gobert has racked up 912 wins and six state titles. Gobert has a career winning percentage of over 78% in his career along with 27 sectional and 17 regional titles. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Eyewitness News (WEHT/WTVW).",
